transfer-title = Import / Export
transfer-subtitle = Your data and content, ready to go
transfer-scope = Complete backup: settings, operator and event profiles, shortcuts, playlists, lyrics and linked versions, themes, designs, media, texts, saved verses, folders, Bible translations, interface themes and plugins. Local images and media are included in the ZIP.
transfer-exclusions = Chat history, chat uploads, certificates, installed system fonts, caches and external tools are not included. Online videos remain links and are not downloaded. This is a complete restore, not a merge or selective import.
transfer-sensitive = Backups are not encrypted and may contain private profile data, passwords and plugin scripts. Store them securely and only import trusted packages.
transfer-export = Export ZIP…
transfer-import = Choose backup…
transfer-export-card = Export backup
transfer-export-hint = Save settings, library and local files in a ZIP.
transfer-import-card = Import backup
transfer-import-hint = Recover your data from an Omni Presenter backup.
transfer-lyrics-hint = Add lyrics from text, subtitles or presentations without replacing songs.
transfer-details = Backup contents, formats and precautions
transfer-package-details = View package contents
transfer-exported = File exported successfully.
transfer-missing = Missing local files (paths retained)
transfer-assets = Included files
transfer-restore-warning = All backed-up categories in this workspace will be REPLACED. Chat data is retained. A before_import ZIP is saved beside the database before changes. The application closes after restoration; reopen it to use the imported workspace. Unsaved editors outside Settings are not included in exports.
transfer-confirm = I understand that this replaces the current data and requires reopening the application.
transfer-restore = Restore and close application
transfer-working = Processing files in the background. Please wait; do not shut down the application.
transfer-reopen = The application closes when restoration finishes. Reopen it from the same workspace directory.
transfer-invalid = Invalid, incompatible or oversized workspace package. No database changes were applied.
transfer-lyrics = Import lyrics
transfer-lyrics-formats = Text without extension, TXT, TEXT, MD, LRC, SRT, VTT, PPTX, DOCX, ODT and ODP. Text must be UTF-8 or UTF-16 with BOM. Presentations import text only, one stanza per slide, not images or animations.
