lyrics-invalid-text = Invalid text encoding or binary content. Save as UTF-8 or UTF-16 with BOM.
lyrics-too-large = Too many files or the import size limit was exceeded.
lyrics-unsupported = Unsupported file format or document structure. Convert to TXT, PPTX or DOCX.
